BLA - 25&nbsp;<br /> 6. MOLINERA - 20&nbsp;<br /> 7. GAVIOTA - 17.5</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; \">TOTAL - 165 PUNTOS</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">27-04-2011</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; \">GANADERIA HNOS. BENAVENT. QUATRETONDA - VALENCIA.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; \">1. CARBONERA - 11.25&nbsp;<br /> 2. LADRONA - 28.75&nbsp;<br /> 3. VENTOLERA - 25&nbsp;<br /> T. PALOMO - 18.75&nbsp;<br /> 4. CAMPESINA - 18.75&nbsp;<br /> 5. NIEBLA - 25&nbsp;<br /> 6. MOLINERA - 20&nbsp;<br /> 7. GAVIOTA - 17.5</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 18px; \">TOTAL - 165 PUNTOS</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">26-04-2011</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">La ganaderia de Javier Tarrega &quot;El Gallo&quot; a obtenido la siguiente puntuaci&oacute;n:</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">1. SOTANA - 12 PUNTOS</span><br /> <span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">2. CELOSA - 12 PUNTOS</span><br /> <span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">3. VINAGRA - 12 PUNTOS</span><br /> <span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \"><span class=\"text_exposed_show\" style=\"display: inline; \">T. NAPOLE&Oacute;N - 16 PUNTOS<br /> 4. GOLONDRINA - 15 PUNTOS<br /> 5. CULEBRA - 20 PUNTOS<br /> 6. TACONERA - 15 PUNTOS<br /> 7. GENERALA - 15 PUNTOS</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\">TOTAL - 117 PUNTOS</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">24-04-2011</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">La ganadrria de Hnos. Dominguez obtuvo ayer la siguiente puntuaci&oacute;n:</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">1. LEONA - 16.25 PUNTOS.</span><br /> <span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">2. CODICIOSA - 12.5 PUNTOS.</span><br /> <span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">3. SALSERA - 20 PUNTOS.</span><br /> <span class=\"Apple-style-span\" style=\"font-family: 'lucida grande', tahoma, verdana, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px; \">T. NAVARRO - 15 PUNT